      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A radioisotopic technique which, through the injection of 99mTc-red cell into the pulmonary artery, gives images of left ventricular chamber in RAO at first pass and in LAO at blood pool gated, has been assessed. A quantitative analysis of left ventricular wall motion was performed with semiautomatic program. The Authors report their experience with 42 patients."},
